From: fryezero <108418382+fryezero@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:35:24 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] mu: GFx hitTestDisable, topmostLevel and noAdvance on
 MovieClip

hitTestDisable: the clip and its children are ignored by mouse picking and
hitTest (HUD bars and the chat view use it so clicks reach the game).
topmostLevel: the clip is drawn above the whole stage with its ancestors'
transforms and is picked first (CLIK PopUpManager, dropdown menus).
noAdvance: the clip's and its children's frames and onEnterFrame stop.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
